      },
      "Type": "DisplayText",
      "ItemId": 2,
      "DisplayText": {
        "TargetLanguage": "English",
        "Value": "Promotional armor’s stashed away on the ride display at last. Glad management finally decided to retire that hunk of junk. Now I don’t have to listen to Jacobs bitching about how awkward it is to wear it around the park. Yeah, man, I get it - they miscast the ceramics in the factory, so the thing’s fragile as an egg. One sneeze and it falls to bits and all the kids start crying, oh, boo-hoo. Did that moron honestly think the army would give us military spec hardware to promote cola?"
      }
